config STATEX
	bool "StaTeX maths typesetting"
	depends on CPP
	help
	  Statically-allocated TeX maths renderer (lib/StaTeX) with its SDF
	  glyph store (lib/glyphstore). No heap, no exceptions, no RTTI; the
	  caller supplies a scratch arena and a Graphics2D backend.

	  Requires C++17 (set CONFIG_STD_CPP17=y or newer in the
	  application). The generated glyph atlas is a significant flash
	  consumer; check the map file when enabling. Font subsetting is a
	  table-generator concern, not a build option here (yet).
